<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.1 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK JAN DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.1 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Wednesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.1 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Jan 10			7,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Jan		6,319</p>
<p> Average reserves to Jan 7			    7,003</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,125</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
